{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">菲律賓渡輪大火，死亡人數增至76人，仍有10多人失蹤。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">菲律賓海岸防衛隊船艦，周六將遇難者屍體運到巴拉望省科倫港，岸上有失蹤者家屬等待消息。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">一艘載有117名乘客和17名船員的渡輪，周三晚由馬尼拉駛往科倫港，在抵達前不久發生大火，數十人獲救，多人失蹤，起火原因有待調查。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.PHIL.FIRE-2300_004.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026gVq571k0dW1789222792.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.PHIL.FIRE-2300_004.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-12T14:38:58.154922+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}